#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: killbots.kcfg:38
#, kde-format
msgid "If checked, the game will ignore any move that would result in the immediate death of the hero (other than random teleports and waiting out the round)."
msgstr "Se marcas esta opción, a partida ignorará calquera movemento que cause a morte inmediata do heroe (excepto as teleportacións aleatorias e o pasar a vez)."

